{"id":"ecc1f15e98d07497","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-linear-order.md","title":"Coded Strict Linear Order","display":"df-linear-order — Coded Strict Linear Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-linear-order","aliases":["62-df-linear-order"],"display":"df-linear-order — Coded Strict Linear Order","depends_on":["[[62-df-coded-function]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition V.1.1","source_pages":[167,168],"source_pdf_pages":[185,186]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-linear-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-linear-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-linear-order — Coded Strict Linear Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition V.1.1"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>167</span><span>168</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>185</span><span>186</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,R\">\\(W,R\\)</span> 是数的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rel}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rel}\\)</span>、数值配对见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\">\\(x,y,z\\)</span> 为数变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_R\">\\(\\prec_R\\)</span> 的定义见 Assertion。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order}\\vdash\\;\\mathsf{LO}(W,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Rel}(R,W,W)\\land\n\\forall x\\in W\\neg(x\\prec_R x)\\land\n\\forall x,y,z\\in W((x\\prec_R y\\land y\\prec_R z)\\to x\\prec_R z)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in W(x\\ne y\\to(x\\prec_R y\\lor y\\prec_R x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order}\\vdash\\;\\mathsf{LO}(W,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Rel}(R,W,W)\\land\n\\forall x\\in W\\neg(x\\prec_R x)\\land\n\\forall x,y,z\\in W((x\\prec_R y\\land y\\prec_R z)\\to x\\prec_R z)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in W(x\\ne y\\to(x\\prec_R y\\lor y\\prec_R x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\prec_Ry\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\langle x,y\\rangle_N\\in R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\prec_Ry\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\langle x,y\\rangle_N\\in R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文采用严格关系和显式载体。与书中的反射编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 对应如下：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle_N:x,y\\in W\\land(x=y\\lor x\\prec_R y)\\}\">\\(X=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle_N:x,y\\in W\\land(x=y\\lor x\\prec_R y)\\}\\)</span>；反向取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\{x:\\langle x,x\\rangle_N\\in X\\}\">\\(W=\\{x:\\langle x,x\\rangle_N\\in X\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为去掉对角线的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>。转换由有界理解给出，空载体合法。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition V.1.1；纸面页 167, 168；PDF 页 185, 186。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W,R$ 是数的集合；$\\mathsf{Rel}$、数值配对见 [[62-df-coded-function]]。$x,y,z$ 为数变量；$\\prec_R$ 的定义见 Assertion。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W,R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rel}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order}\\vdash\\;\\mathsf{LO}(W,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Rel}(R,W,W)\\land\n\\forall x\\in W\\neg(x\\prec_R x)\\land\n\\forall x,y,z\\in W((x\\prec_R y\\land y\\prec_R z)\\to x\\prec_R z)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in W(x\\ne y\\to(x\\prec_R y\\lor y\\prec_R x)).","display":true},{"tex":"x\\prec_Ry\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\langle x,y\\rangle_N\\in R.","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle_N:x,y\\in W\\land(x=y\\lor x\\prec_R y)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"W=\\{x:\\langle x,x\\rangle_N\\in X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1317,"backlinks":[{"id":"426b1e91662e3168","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"线性序 $(W,R)$、$(V,S)$ 见 [[62-df-linear-order]]；数值函数图见 [[62-df-coded-function]]。$V_{<a}=\\{v\\in V:v\\prec_S a\\}$，$S|_{V_{<a}}$ 为同时限制两个坐标的诱导序。"},{"id":"0c50226ab37e9ce8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"序、编码和句法见 [[62-df-linear-order]]、[[62-df-coded-function]]、[[62-df-L2]]。$\\theta(n,a,Z,\\bar u,\\bar A)\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；$W,R,H$ 不在 $\\theta$ 中自由出现。$Z$ 是待替换的集合变量。$n,a$ 是不同的数变量，均不同于 $\\bar u$；$Z,H,W,R$ 是不同的集合变量，均不同于 $\\bar A$。这些要求只限制语法变量名，不限制其赋值相等。$\\operatorname{Var},\\operatorname{Ren},\\nu_y$ 采用 [[62-df-L2]] 中的带类型语法递归。下述 $\\mathsf M_Z^{H,W,R,a}$ 以有限公式树为域。"},{"id":"649faa9c6d69237b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"严格序与载体见 [[62-df-linear-order]]，函数图见 [[62-df-coded-function]]。$W,R$ 为数的集合；$f$ 为集合变量。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-linear-order|Coded Strict Linear Order]]"},{"id":"271bc9074a256041","anchor":"ref-253","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-linear-order]]"}],"outgoing":["c156c03daff0aff0"]}